        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/{size}/2006_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-10T00:19:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"grysqrl\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/48/1909_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grysqrl:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Theta_Sigma wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I'd like the ability to learn anything by observing it once. Hear someone speaking another language? You are now fluent in that language. Watch someone dance? You are now an excellent dancer.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nSo basically, you can just watch anyone else use their super power and then you'll be able to use it, too. This sounds pretty sweet.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Only works on skills. The body doesn't have the necessary physiology to do powers. Ask Taskmaster.</p>",
