        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-11T00:28:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think preference for me would be telepathic cloaking, so not just invisibility, but more that when you don't want to be noticed people just don't realise you're there, don't pay attention to you and forget that you were right in front of them just now. As it's a mental effect would trick all senses not just sight and get around that awkward vanishing moment.</p>",
