        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-11T00:48:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mentioned this in the Ask A Forumite thread a while back, but I'll summarize my points:</p><p>Teleportation (with ability to teleport other objects of any size alongside me), because of these three scenarios:</p><p>1) \"Hey there, [COMPANY NAME HERE]! I see you guys just ordered a shipment of [PRODUCT NAME HERE]. Shipping overseas, huh? That's pretty time-consuming. How would you like to pay the same price, but get that shipment over here within the next 2 minutes? You'd like that? Great! Now, sign here...\"</p><p>2) \"Hey, United Nations. Trying to supply impoverished countries in need of food? Finding the shipping process expensive and taking away funds you could use for medicine for those countries? How about I take care of that for you in the next two minutes? Can I take the medicine to them while I'm at it? Great!\"</p><p>3) \"You know, I've never been to Europe. Let me pack a sandwich.\"</p>",
